=Write a short, plain-language weekly AI crawler activity report in {{ $json.language === 'fr' ? 'French' : 'English' }} for {{ $json.siteName }}, covering the last {{ $json.lookbackDays }} day(s).

Request counts by AI crawler user-agent: {{ JSON.stringify($json.activity) }}

Explain clearly which AI engines are visiting. IMPORTANT: mention once, briefly, that this counts self-reported user-agents and technically could include spoofed requests (full cryptographic verification requires Cloudflare's paid Bot Management) -- but keep this caveat to one short sentence, don't dwell on it. Keep the whole report under 150 words, friendly and direct, no markdown headers.

